      "text": {
        "en": "Pet owners consistently commend the attentive approach of the grooming team at Rancho Bernardo. Individual stylists including Sofia, Yvonne, Lisa, and Juliana receive repeated praise for their skill and warm customer rapport. Clients appreciate that staff listen closely to haircut specifications and show sincere attention to pets."
      }
