      "sentiment": "positive",
      "mentions": 12,
      "title": {
        "en": "Precision cuts and coat styling"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Reviews highlight exceptional grooming results for various breeds, especially doodles, mini schnauzers, and rescue dogs. Owners report clean cuts, fluffy blowouts, tidy sanitary trims, and creative styling options such as mohawks. Clients frequently mention that dogs return smelling fresh and wearing complimentary little bandanas."
      }
    },
    {
      "topic": "animals",
      "sentiment": "positive",
      "mentions": 11,
      "title": {
        "en": "Gentle care for anxious dogs"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Families frequently note how patiently groomers handle reactive, nervous, or first-time puppy clients. Reviewers appreciate that the team takes extra time to acclimate pets to grooming equipment, helping them feel secure throughout the process. Dogs return home relaxed and in good spirits rather than showing signs of stress."
      }
    }
